  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increase resilience of vulnerable communities to the effects of El Ni o in Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The interventions will address the impact of the climate change by exploiting agriculture practices and technics that will include the promotion of genetic diversity, inter-crop diversity, switching to crops that are more resilient, use of better-adapted varieties of the same crop developed through on-farm selection, reinforce formal breeding programs, participatory plant breeding, conservation agriculture, etc.</narrative>
  </description>
